s an investment in the future, a commitment to a dream. Our students graduate with skills they\u2019ll use in exciting and challenging professions that expand the frontiers of science, healthcare, technology, and education for our society as a whole. Backed by programs with national rankings, our renowned faculty come from all CU Anschutz schools to serve more than 4,000 graduate students.\nAdmissions\nApply here! View application details and admissions requirements.\nApply Now\nRequest Information\nSign up to receive more information about our programs and resources.\nJoin Our Mailing List\nPrograms\nExplore all master's, doctoral, non-degree, and online options.\nView Program List\nVirtual Tour\nCheck out CU Anschutz through this interactive virtual tour.\nOpen Virtual Tour\nCareer Development\nLearn how to develop skills for a successful transition into your career.\nLearn more about the CDO\nContact Us\nContact the Graduate School for any questions not answered on our website.\nContact Us\nUpcoming Prospective Student Events\nMaster's Showcase\nJoin us each spring semester for this virtual event to learn more about master's offerings through the CU Anschutz Graduate School.\nLearn More and Register for the Master's Showcase\nBiomed Expo\nThe Biomedical Expo is an annual, week-long showcase of our biomedical science PhD programs. Each fall, programs will provide an overview and answer your questions about student life, research, admissions, and more!\nLearn More and Register for the Biomed Expo\nGraduate School\nCU Anschutz\nFitzsimons Building\n13001 East 17th Place\nC5000\nAurora,\nCO\n80045\n303-724-2915\nFacebook\nTwitter\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nProspective Students\nApply Now\nSend me more information\nNeed Help?\nContact Us\nReport Mistreatment\nHelpCompass\nContact Us\nWebsite Feedback\nCU System\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nAccessibility\nAccreditation\nEmployment\nGive Now\n\u00a9 2026 The Regents of the University of Colorado, a body corporate. All righ